.org/wiki/%E9%A9%AC%E6%99%AE%E6%89%98"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93416252"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3889"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159149485","name":"太特","country":"MOZ","lat":-16.17003,"lon":33.58001,"kind":"city","region":"MZ-T","rank":4,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"太特 · 地形、历史与地方特色","geo":"在葡萄牙东非之前，它曾是斯瓦希里人的贸易中心；现在它仍然是莫桑比克的西部中心（区域中心），也是赞比亚河流域最大城市。\n其位于赞比西河畔，拥有莫桑比克境内四座大桥中的两座。\n太特的钦戈兹伊机场位于城市东北侧，拥有2.4公里跑道。","culture":"第二个大桥位于城市南侧，建于2014年，可以将部分赞比亚与马拉维的车流分流出省会城市。\n葡萄牙殖民者逐步控制了这一地区，到17世纪中期，太特成为了区域重要的象牙和黄金贸易中心。","see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q388242","articleTitle":"太特","sourceRevision":89954252,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 太特","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%AA%E7%89%B9"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89954252"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q388242"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/"]]}},{"id":"city-1159149487","name":"彭巴","country":"MOZ","lat":-12.98305,"lon":40.53235,"kind":"city","region":"MZ-P","rank":4,"capital":0,"knowledge":{"theme":"彭巴 · 地点概要","geo":"彭巴（葡萄牙语：）是位于莫桑比克北部彭巴湾沿岸的一座城市。","culture":null,"see":null,"scope":"reference","qid":"Q498048","articleTitle":"彭巴","sourceRevision":94777482,"method":"Full-article section excerpts; traditional Chinese converted to simplified; tables, citations, population and current-office statistics omitted.","attribution":"中文维基百科资料摘编、删节与繁简转换 · CC BY-SA 4.0（作者见原文历史）","sources":[["地点资料 · 彭巴","https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BD%AD%E5%B7%B4"],["原文版本与作者","https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94777482"],["地点身份 · Wikidata","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q498048"],["资料许可 · CC BY-SA 4.0","https://creativecom